Hephaestus — hard sciences and productive work (@hephaestus: 0, is #chapter, #hephaestus "mathematics/Mathematics.lingua#r_0BDE857C410434BA79D017008C", #hephaestus "physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W", #hephaestus "chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0", #hephaestus "computer-science/Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641", #hephaestus "engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #hephaestus "inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB", #hephaestus-core "mathematics/Mathematics.lingua#r_0BDE857C410434BA79D017008C", #hephaestus-core "physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W", #hephaestus-core "chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0", #hephaestus-core "computer-science/Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641", #hephaestus-core "engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #hephaestus-core "inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB", #contains "mathematics/Mathematics.lingua#r_0BDE857C410434BA79D017008C", #contains "physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W", #contains "chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0", #contains "computer-science/Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641", #contains "engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #contains "inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB") { r_00000000000000000000002001
Within Ergon, Hephaestus develops the hard sciences and the engineering and computing knowledge needed to understand, reproduce and sustain modern technical systems. Begin from ordinary questions and explicit quantities, then deepen into theory, practical work, critical scholarship and independent research. [Gaia](../gaia/Nature.lingua#r_5DAMNRQZX9M2PRPHVJB673XX21) supplies connected Earth, life, food and health knowledge.

Choose one of six broad areas. Each begins with a common introductory lesson; its full core and major branches are being developed before further specialist extensions.

- [Mathematics — quantity, structure, space, change and proof](mathematics/Mathematics.lingua#r_0BDE857C410434BA79D017008C).
- [Physics — matter, motion, fields and physical evidence](physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W).
- [Chemistry — substances, structure and transformations](chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0).
- [Computing — representation, algorithms and working systems](computer-science/Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641).
- [Engineering — useful systems from design through continuing service](engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68).
- [Scientific inquiry and practice — questions, evidence and shared knowledge](inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB).

Engineering contains production, materials, utilities, facilities, logistics, maintenance and recovery. Clean manufacturing belongs within production engineering. Astronomy and astrophysics belong within physics. Shared quantitative and investigative methods remain reusable across every area.

Development proceeds outward in successive passes: establish the six area cores, develop their major branches across the tree, then deepen specialized subjects. A core must teach and support substantive work; an entrance or list of topics does not complete it. Each trail ultimately runs from an accessible beginning through advanced academic and practical formation. Existing specialist work remains available and retains its scope and identities.

Use the opening lessons to understand the shared questions of each area. Return to existing specialist material when a particular problem needs it, and follow the linked foundations where preparation is missing.

**Trail authoring:** [Trails](../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_7A4AY51TXG87NVHR9J1XNZTJQ9).

**Parent:** [Ergon](../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1).

**Scope:** This is the home of the former STEM hard-science plans: mathematics, physics, chemistry, engineering, computing, astronomy, materials, energy, manufacturing, logistics, facilities, and maintenance, with shared inquiry and learning methods. Start from [Hephaestus](Hephaestus.lingua). Develop each subject in a descriptive subdirectory beneath its field directory. Pure theory belongs here as fully as its applications; immediate industrial usefulness is not a requirement.

**Branches:**

- [Mathematics — quantity, structure, space, change and proof](mathematics/Mathematics.lingua#r_0BDE857C410434BA79D017008C)
- [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W)
- [Chemistry — substances, transformations, and evidence](chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0)
- [Computing — representation, algorithms and working systems](computer-science/Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641)
- [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68)
- [Scientific inquiry and practice — questions, evidence and shared knowledge](inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB)
} r_00000000000000000000002001

